    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Basic Facility</em></p><p>Hearths, ovens, and larders to feed the Bastion; a fine place to start a game session.</p><p>A basic facility comes with nonmagical furnishings and decor suited to it. Basic facilities have no game effects, but they inspire roleplaying and make a Bastion feel real. A Bastion starts with two free basic facilities (one Cramped, one Roomy) and can have more than one of each. Adding one costs 500 GP and 20 days (Cramped), 1,000 GP and 45 days (Roomy), or 3,000 GP and 125 days (Vast); enlarging one costs 500 GP and 25 days (Cramped to Roomy) or 2,000 GP and 80 days (Roomy to Vast).</p>",
